  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Called to Care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Called to Care project aims to produce and distribute a toolkit of 10 practical, action-oriented handbooks on issues related to HIV and AIDS, designed for church leaders, especially (but not only) in sub-Saharan Africa. The purpose of the project is to empower church leaders and congregations with the knowledge, attitudes, skills and strategies they need to plan and implement effective responses to the challenges of the HIV epidemic in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
